for slice(r11) -> L1 else L2 stages [L1, L5, L6, L7, L8, L9]
// L1: free {take, const, *}
// L5: cycle Storage(r12) in_order law(Fold(r12, #2) exact) {ref, call push}
// L6: free {take, const}
// L7: cycle Storage(r13) any_order law(Op(Add) exact commutative) {take, +, -, assign}
// L8: free {take}
// L9: cycle Storage(r14) any_order law(Op(Max) exact commutative) {take, >, take, assign, branch}
// control upfront
// cost W=10 O=18305 split when n > 58576, n = len(r11)
